        "content_blocks": [
          {
            "_uid": "5633fc59-d1a8-4123-a1cb-7b599a0ecfd4",
            "text": "Introduction",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "1fb12746-6ddc-49e6-94b7-e3e248e6e8ac",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "In today’s digital-first UAE market, your website isn’t just a digital brochure - it’s your ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "most powerful business asset.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hard_break"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Whether you’re launching a startup in Dubai, a retail brand in Sharjah, or a corporate firm in Abu Dhabi, your online presence determines how customers perceive your credibility and value.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "But here’s the challenge: with so many web development companies in the UAE promising “best websites” and “top SEO results,” how do you know which one truly delivers?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "At ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "IGENTX",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", we believe the best agency is the one that aligns ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "technology, design, and strategy",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " to drive measurable business growth - not just build a website.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "f7e3a3ae-e21f-4d37-bb03-9de5a7fee619",
            "text": "Understand What You Really Need",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "e20eb64d-85d1-4bd9-b9c4-3785888afe97",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Before choosing a web development company, clarify your goals:",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "1 - Do you need an ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "ecommerce site",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " that sells efficiently?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "2 - A ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "corporate website",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " that builds trust?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "3 - Or an ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "SEO-optimized platform",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " that drives leads?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "The right agency won't jump into coding. They'll start by understanding your audience, objectives, and brand personality.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "13acb02e-e83e-4cbc-8bad-800cf564f886",
            "text": "At IGENTX, every project begins with strategy - not templates. We build websites that work for your business goals.",
            "author": "",
            "component": "blog_quote",
            "author_role": "",
            "background_color": ""
          },
          {
            "_uid": "698645b0-493d-491b-8576-0e9f1f283d91",
            "text": "Look for Technical Expertise and Modern Tools",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "99e6a16f-0973-4363-942c-2c1ee27aab71",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Web development in 2025 is no longer just about HTML and WordPress.",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hard_break"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Top agencies use ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "AI, automation, and advanced frameworks",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " to build faster, smarter, and scalable websites.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "7030de32-f80d-4939-a42a-a73151850ce3",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "When choosing your partner, ask:",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "1. Do they use AI-assisted tools for faster builds and optimization?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "2. Are their websites optimized for ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "speed, SEO, and multilingual support?",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "3. Do they offer custom dashboards or integrations?",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "At ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "IGENTX",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", we leverage ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "AI-powered automation",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " to deliver websites ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "faster delivery",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", with ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "SEO-first architecture",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " and ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "responsive bilingual designs",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " perfect for UAE’s diverse market.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "40e6a06f-281d-448b-a34e-08faaef99494",
            "text": "Check Their Portfolio and Case Studies",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "85a481a5-cee9-4faa-822c-5bec509ebae1",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "A good web agency’s portfolio should show more than just visuals - it should tell a story of ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "measurable growth",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ".",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "8c3d52cc-4ace-4477-97cd-3518313b9c76",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Look for examples where:",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "1 - Website redesigns led to traffic or conversion improvements",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "2 - The agency handled complex ecommerce or multilingual systems",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "3 - The UI/UX aligns with modern global standards",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "608170cb-5a87-454e-ac04-b78d56a0d96a",
            "text": "At IGENTX, our portfolio includes AI-driven ecommerce platforms, SEO-optimized corporate websites, and fast-loading landing pages built for UAE businesses.",
            "author": "",
            "component": "blog_quote",
            "author_role": "",
            "background_color": ""
          },
          {
            "_uid": "41ee0c92-4893-46c0-a6dc-fc14237ada38",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "This proves expertise - not just aesthetics.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "ddd0b5a2-896b-4db9-92c9-0b8407728774",
            "text": "Evaluate SEO and Performance Expertise",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "d5a74656-c281-4324-bf22-c637850a3698",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Many agencies build beautiful sites that ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "don’t rank",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ".",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hard_break"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "The best web development agencies in the UAE know that SEO and web design go hand in hand.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "191160f8-e1a6-4e36-9144-60f0b7d27aba",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "Before hiring, ensure your agency:",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "1 - Implements ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "on-page SEO",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ", schema, and meta optimization",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "2 - Uses ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "AI-based keyword analysis",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " for better rankings",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "3 - Designs for ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Core Web Vitals",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " (speed, mobile, interactivity)",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "IGENTX",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": " integrates SEO into every stage of development - so your website isn’t just live, it’s ",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "visible",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": ".",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "18789b45-f24b-4b5e-b782-f36ce77e16a9",
            "text": "Prioritize Communication and Long-Term Support",
            "level": "h2",
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_heading"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "c891c7f5-fe60-4bf7-9e6f-997c707e6e0d",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "attrs": {
                    "textAlign": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "The UAE business landscape moves fast - and your website should evolve with it.",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hard_break"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Choose a web development partner that offers ongoing support, analytics, and updates.",
                      "type": "text"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "alignment": "",
            "component": "blog_body"
          },
          {
            "_uid": "4648a7b1-fbed-453d-8770-6b34305dd40f",
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
